{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "document_id": "pre-standards",
  "title": "LFS and Standards",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The structure of LFS follows Linux standards as closely as possible. The primary standards are:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "href": "https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/",
                "label": "POSIX.1-2008"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "href": "https://refspecs.linuxfoundation.org/FHS_3.0/fhs/index.html",
                "label": "Filesystem Hierarchy Standard (FHS) Version 3.0"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "href": "https://refspecs.linuxfoundation.org/lsb.shtml",
                "label": "Linux Standard Base (LSB) Version 5.0 (2015)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The LSB has four separate specifications: Core, Desktop, Languages, and Imaging. Some parts of Core and Desktop specifications are architecture specific. There are also two trial specifications: Gtk3 and Graphics. LFS attempts to conform to the LSB specifications for the IA32 (32-bit x86) or AMD64 (x86_64) architectures discussed in the previous section."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "admonition",
            "kind": "note",
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Many people do not agree with these requirements. The main purpose of the LSB is to ensure that proprietary software can be installed and run on a compliant system. Since LFS is source based, the user has complete control over what packages are desired; you may choose not to install some packages that are specified by the LSB."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "While it is possible to create a complete system that will pass the LSB certification tests"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "from scratch,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "this can't be done without many additional packages that are beyond the scope of the LFS book. Installation instructions for some of these additional packages can be found in BLFS."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "definition_list",
      "title": "",
      "entries": [
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Core:"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Bash, Bc, Binutils, Coreutils, Diffutils, File, Findutils, Gawk, GCC, Gettext, Glibc, Grep, Gzip, M4, Man-DB, Procps, Psmisc, Sed, Shadow,"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Systemd , Tar, Util-linux, Zlib"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Desktop:"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "None"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Languages:"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Perl"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Imaging:"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "None"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Gtk3 and LSB Graphics (Trial Use):"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "None"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "definition_list",
      "title": "",
      "entries": [
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Core:"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "At, Batch (a part of At), BLFS Bash Startup Files, Cpio, Ed, Fcrontab, LSB-Tools, NSPR, NSS, Linux-PAM, Pax, Sendmail (or Postfix or Exim), Time"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Desktop:"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Alsa, ATK, Cairo, Desktop-file-utils, Freetype, Fontconfig, Gdk-pixbuf, Glib2, GLU, Icon-naming-utils, Libjpeg-turbo, Libxml2, Mesa, Pango, Xdg-utils, Xorg"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Languages:"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Libxml2, Libxslt"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Imaging:"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "CUPS, Cups-filters, Ghostscript, SANE"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Gtk3 and LSB Graphics (Trial Use):"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "GTK+3"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "definition_list",
      "title": "",
      "entries": [
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Core:"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "install_initd"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": ","
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libcrypt.so.1"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(can be provided with optional instructions for the LFS Libxcrypt package),"
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libncurses.so.5"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(can be provided with optional instructions for the LFS Ncurses package),"
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libncursesw.so.5"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(but"
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libncursesw.so.6"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "is provided by the LFS Ncurses package)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Desktop:"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libgdk-x11-2.0.so"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(but"
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libgdk-3.so"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "is provided by the BLFS GTK+-3 package),"
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libgtk-x11-2.0.so"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(but"
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libgtk-3.so"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "and"
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libgtk-4.so"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "are provided by the BLFS GTK+-3 and GTK-4 packages),"
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libpng12.so"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(but"
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libpng16.so"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "is provided by the BLFS Libpng package),"
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libQt*.so.4"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(but"
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libQt6*.so.6"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "are provided by the BLFS Qt6 package),"
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libtiff.so.4"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(but"
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libtiff.so.6"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "is provided by the BLFS Libtiff package)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Languages:"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "/usr/bin/python"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(LSB requires Python2 but LFS and BLFS only provide Python3)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Imaging:"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "None"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "term": [
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "LSB Gtk3 and LSB Graphics (Trial Use):"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libpng15.so"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(but"
                },
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "libpng16.so"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "is provided by the BLFS Libpng package)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
